  "title": "Meet The Short List: A Facebook Community Made for Petite Women",
  "summary": "Finding clothes when you’re petite can feel like its own full time job. The inseam is too long. The waist hits in the wrong place. The sleeves swallow your hands. And somehow, “petite” still means something different at every brand. That is exactly why we created The Short List,",
